 {#veda yatpraRayaBaNgavedanAm#} <ls>Ki. 13. 60</ls>; <ls>Ms. 8. 21</ls>.
.²7 To be impeded or hindered; {#Darme sIdati satvaraH#} <ls>Ms. 9. 94</ls>.
